          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[연습의 교육적 의미에 대한 고찰 - Bollnow의 견해를 중심으로]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Study on the Educational Meaning of Exercise(Übung) - From the Viewpoint of Pedagogical Anthropogoy of Otto F. Bollnow]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Study on the Educational Meaning of Exercise(Übung) - From the Viewpoint of Pedagogical Anthropogoy of Otto F. Bollnow]]></article-title>
